<title>USA: Grey Advertising Inc Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Grey Advertising Inc Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$3.71		    $3.21</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 3.58		     3.11</p>
<p> Net			  5,047		    4,405</p>
<p> Revs		   1,217,188		1,162,427</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	 1,296		    1,280</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	 1,351		    1,332</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary	     $13.46		   $10.07</p>
<p> Shr diluted		12.98		     9.71</p>
<p> Net			 18,117		   14,104</p>
<p> Revs		   3,618,455		3,307,766</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	 1,296		    1,307</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	 1,351		    1,367</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - First nine months of 1996 includes a one-time, pre-tax gain of about $4 million, which was recognized in Q1 1996, primarily related to the sale of an equity position in a non-consolidated subsidiary and the liquidation of a non-marketable investment security.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
